# Apixaban: gas-phase single-point on a solvent-optimized geometry
# Purpose:
#   E_gas(X_solvent) for separating structural relaxation from solvation.
#
# Use the final optimized XYZ geometry from the corresponding SMD-Opt calculation.
# This calculation removes the SMD solvent model; only the gas-phase electronic
# energy at the solvent-optimized geometry is evaluated.

! r2SCAN-3c TightSCF

%pal
  nprocs 4
end

%maxcore 2000

* xyzfile 0 1 Apixaban_SMD_dmso_Opt.xyz
